{
  "about": [
    "The hrefs of wikilinks and hashtags, for every renderer of the Flat Markdown AST.",
    "The Rust tests of flatmarkdown-ast2html and the tests of the npm package read this file.",
    "flatmarkdown-ast2react keeps a copy of it, so that its TypeScript gives the same hrefs.",
    "When the rule changes, change this table first.",
    "kind is wikilink or hashtag. name is the url of the wikilink or the name of the tag.",
    "template is the href template, and fragmentPattern the pattern of a fragment; both of the wikilink when kind is wikilink.",
    "href is the URL, before it is escaped for HTML."
  ],
